WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.470
Contrast-Consistent Search, or CCS,

00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:09.101
is an unsupervised probe that reads a language
model's sense of truth from its activations.

00:00:09.181 --> 00:00:11.725
But what does CCS actually optimize?

00:00:11.805 --> 00:00:17.335
This paper explains its target and derives a new
loss, Midpoint-Displacement,

00:00:17.415 --> 00:00:19.740
that matches CCS and can beat it.
